# Generated by the package's `prepare` script (which runs on every
# `pnpm install`) — both the TS consumer-facing string export and the raw IIFE
# that the Rust crate `shared-structures-tauri-rust` embeds via `include_str!`.
# CI's tauri lint/test job runs `pnpm install` before `cargo build` so the
# regenerated bytes are picked up.
src/tauri-bootstrap.generated.ts
# `dist/tauri-bootstrap.js` is covered by the workspace root .gitignore's
# `**/dist/**` rule — kept centralized there for consistency with the other
# slices' build outputs.
